A built binary embeds the Go Mono fonts, through
golang.org/x/image/font/gofont. They were made for the Go project by
Bigelow & Holmes and are licensed under the Go project's own BSD-style
licence, whose text is carried with them at
golang.org/x/image/font/gofont/ttfs/README; redistributing a built binary
redistributes them.
